{"approved":false,"back_sample":null,"beam_size":2,"checks":{"no_residual_markers":true,"nonempty":true,"not_truncated":true,"protected_values":true,"translated":true},"context":"car-lease-calculator UI copy.fields.formulaNote","detected_language":"ms","format":"usefulverse-background-draft-v1","key":"car-lease-calculator.copy.fields.formulaNote","keys":["car-lease-calculator.copy.fields.formulaNote"],"locale":"id","model":"google/madlad400-3b-mt","raw_translation":"Biaya disesuaikan = biaya kapitalisasi − pengurangan. Depresiasi bulanan = (biaya disesuaikan − sisa) ÷ bulan. Biaya sewa bulanan = (biaya disesuaikan + sisa) × faktor uang. Pajak hanya diterapkan pada perkiraan pembayaran bulanan sebelum pajak.","record_id":"102b2476f077fcc3de83aaf95be5497ee10597068ff94d4dedfadd93791ef1b8","revision":"fa184c675da0b5c9e1c8694fccd4e12e2d422094","run_id":"40658885003","seconds":1.6282175187500059,"source":"Adjusted cost = capitalized cost − reduction. Monthly depreciation = (adjusted cost − residual) ÷ months. Monthly rent charge = (adjusted cost + residual) × money factor. Tax is applied only to the estimated pre-tax monthly payment.","source_commit":"eb6b1a93248bb554a61ee97166d91f6524e72a78","source_hash":"664d6171212d6672f8728c9d6e1858634b2f6f3f88b5c98f6d9afff379aef273","status":"needs-review","translation":"Biaya disesuaikan = biaya kapitalisasi − pengurangan. Depresiasi bulanan = (biaya disesuaikan − sisa) ÷ bulan. Biaya sewa bulanan = (biaya disesuaikan + sisa) × faktor uang. Pajak hanya diterapkan pada perkiraan pembayaran bulanan sebelum pajak.","truncated":false,"warnings":["language_detection"]}
